    'projects.sparklequiz.context' => 'SparkleQuiz is my own business: I have been designing, building and running it on my own since 2025. You can play solo, with a progression system, or with others in rooms synchronised in real time. Players create their own quizzes, add friends and track their statistics. The app is free, playable in the browser and available on both mobile stores.',
